	<!-- Interlude cubic ID 9: Attractive Cubic. Control cubic that periodically uses Cubic Hate and Hold against the owner's valid combat target. -->
	<!-- Attribute guide: duration is active time in seconds; delay is action interval in seconds; maxCount limits activations. -->
	<!-- Attribute guide: useUp controls removal after maxCount; power controls cubic skill formula strength when used by the runtime. -->
	<!-- Attribute guide: selectionMode controls skill selection; targetType controls target resolution for TARGET or HEAL behavior. -->
